  "notable_quotes": [
    "Compounds 1 and 2 are isostructural 3D frameworks with multidimensional intersecting ring channels built from {[Zn7(trz)6]8+}n 2D layers.",
    "The rigid carboxylate-plus-trz design is a feasible route to 3D pillared-layer MOFs with polynuclear metal clusters in Zn/trz systems.",
    "All four compounds adopt 3D pillared-layer structures in which Zn/trz units form 2D layers and aromatic carboxylates act as pillars between layers."
